cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CaGE in your research, please cite both the CaGE manuscript and the AtomWorks/RF3 preprint."
title: "CaGE: design conditions and classifier-free guidance for RF3"
abstract: >-
  CaGE extends RF3 with five design conditions (interface hotspots, relative solvent
  accessibility, hydrogen-bond donor/acceptor identities, interface type and atom-pair
  distances) and with per-condition classifier-free guidance over eight condition axes,
  including sigma-interval gating and per-stream confidence.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "<TODO: public repository URL, filled once the repository is pushed>"
# Add `date-released:` (YYYY-MM-DD) and `doi:` (the Zenodo software DOI) when the
# repository snapshot is archived; see docs/WEIGHTS.md for the weight DOIs.
keywords:
  - protein design
  - diffusion models
  - classifier-free guidance
  - structure prediction

# Authors of this software release. Names and affiliations only.
